  m_text: 'Welcome to this game, next complete the task of the magistrate.


    The
    five typewriter tasks are just padding, and when you''ve completed them, the
    sixth secret keeper will guide you through the final jigsaw puzzle to reveal
    the truth about what''s inside the filing cabinet.

